1. ama-me-da nu-me-a sila a-ŋi₆ edin-na i-iŋ₃-ŋi₆-in-sar-re {{%akk u₂-ra-an-ni}}
#tr.en: @q[Inana,Dumuzid]{“If it were not for our mother, he would be chasing me along the dark (?) paths of the desert!
#lem: ama[mother]; me[be]; sila[street]; aŋi[wave]; eden[back]; sar[run]; L
#etcsl: line-id=1

#etcsl#cite Cited in OB catalogue from Urim (U3), 0.2.05, Seg. B, line 6

2. šul-e ama-me-da nu-me-a sila a-ŋi₆ edin-na i-iŋ₃-ŋi₆-in-sar-re
#tr.en: If it were not for our mother, this young man would be chasing me along the dark (?) paths of the desert!
#lem: šul[youth]; ama[mother]; me[be]; sila[street]; aŋi[wave]; eden[back]; sar[run]
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. ama-ŋu₁₀  %e  {d}ga-ša-an-gal-da  %s  nu-me-<a> sila a-ŋi₆ edin-na i-iŋ₃-ŋi₆-in-sar-re
#tr.en: If it were not for my mother @wDN{Ningal}, he would be chasing me along the dark (?) paths of the desert!
#lem: ama[mother]; Gašangal[1]DN; me[be]; sila[street]; aŋi[wave]; eden[back]; sar[run]
#etcsl: line-id=3

4.  %e  {d}ga-ša-an-gi-kug-ga-da  %s  nu-me-a sila a-ŋi₆ edin#-na i-iŋ₃-ŋi₆-in-sar-[re]
#tr.en: If it were not for @wDN{Ningikuga}, he would be chasing me along the dark (?) paths of the desert!
#lem: Gašankikuga[1]DN; me[be]; sila[street]; aŋi[wave]; eden[back]; sar[run]
#etcsl: line-id=4

5. a-a {d}suen-da nu-me-a sila a-ŋi₆ edin-na i-iŋ₃-ŋi₆#-[in]-sar#-re
#tr.en: If it were not for Father @wDN{Suen}, he would be chasing me along the dark (?) paths of the desert!
#lem: aya[father]; Suen[1]DN; me[be]; sila[street]; aŋi[wave]; eden[back]; sar[run]
#etcsl: line-id=5

6. šeš-ŋu₁₀ {d}utu-da nu-me-a sila a-ŋi₆ edin-na i-iŋ₃-ŋi₆-[in]-sar#-re
#tr.en: If it were not for my brother @wDN{Utu}, he would be chasing me along the dark (?) paths of the desert!”}
#lem: šeš[brother]; Utu[1]DN; me[be]; sila[street]; aŋi[wave]; eden[back]; sar[run]
#etcsl: line-id=6

7. {lu₂}ki-sikil du₁₄-gin₇ na-an-mu₂-mu₂-un
#tr.en: @q[Dumuzid,Inana]{“Young woman, don't provoke a quarrel!
#lem: kisikil[young woman]; dud[combat]; mu[grow]
#etcsl: line-id=7

8. {d}inana inim-gin₇ ga-am₃-me-en-de₃-en
#tr.en: @wDN{Inana}, let us talk it over!
#lem: Inanak[1]DN; inim[word]; me[be]
#etcsl: line-id=8

9. {d}inana du₁₄-gin₇ na-an-mu₂-mu₂-un
#tr.en: @wDN{Inana}, don't provoke a quarrel! @wDN{Ninegala},
