23. inim bi₂-in-eš-a inim hi-li-eš-am₃
#tr.en: The words they speak are words towards desire;
#lem: inim[word]; e[speak]; inim[word]; hili[attractiveness]
#etcsl: line-id=23

24. du₁₄ mu₂-mu₂-da-a hi-li šag₄-ga-na-ke₄
#tr.en: provoking a quarrel is the desire of his heart!
#lem: dud[combat]; mu[grow]; hili[attractiveness]; šag[heart]
#etcsl: line-id=24

25. {na₄}šuba-ke₄# {na₄}šuba-ke₄ {na₄}šuba na-ur₁₁-ru
#tr.en: He of the @fsux{šuba} jewels, he of the @fsux{šuba} jewels is indeed ploughing with the @fsux{šuba} jewels!
#lem: šuba[precious stone]; šuba[precious stone]; šuba[precious stone]; uru[sow]
#etcsl: line-id=25

26. {d}ama-ušumgal-an-na {na₄}šuba-ke₄ {na₄}šuba na-ur₁₁-ru
#tr.en: @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, he of the @fsux{šuba} jewels, is indeed ploughing with the @fsux{šuba} jewels!
#lem: Amaʾušumgalanak[1]DN; šuba[precious stone]; šuba[precious stone]; uru[sow]
#etcsl: line-id=26

27. {na₄}šuba-na {na₄}šuba tur-tur-bi nu-mu-ne₂-eš na-ŋa₂#-[ŋa₂]
#tr.en: He lays down like seeds the little jewels among his jewels.
#lem: šuba[precious stone]; šuba[precious stone]; tur[small]; e[speak]; ŋar[put]
#etcsl: line-id=27

28. {[na₄]}šuba-na# {na₄}šuba gal-gal-bi guru₇#-še₃ na-du₃-[du₃]
#tr.en: He piles up (?) like grain piles the large jewels among his jewels.
#lem: šuba[precious stone]; šuba[precious stone]; gal[big]; guru[grain store]; du[build]
#etcsl: line-id=28

29. PI-na-ni ur₃#-ra la₂-la₂-a ur₃-ra mu#-na-ab-la₂-[la₂]
#tr.en: He will carry them to the roof for his …… who is leaning towards him from the roof;
#lem: X; ur[roof]; la[hang]; ur[roof]; la[hang]
#etcsl: line-id=29

30. {d}inana [bad₃]-da la₂-la₂-a bad₃-da mu-na-ab-la₂-[la₂]
#tr.en: he will carry them to the wall for @wDN{Inana} who is leaning towards him from the wall.
#lem: Inanak[1]DN; bad[wall]; la[hang]; bad[wall]; la[hang]
#etcsl: line-id=30

